ysterious cataclysm rendering their home planet uninhabitable, Lunarians begin a new start on their once-moon, Luna, with the help of their technologically advanced newly made neighbors, the Astralites. Although Luna is a peaceful world, the Lunarians' cataclysm had an immediate effect on Luna, which caused apprehension among its native inhabitants, the Gillamoorians. The Trials, a long-held worldwide event that takes place every 250 years, is triggered over 100 years earlier than expected in synchronicity with the Lunarians' cataclysm\u2014an occurrence completely unheard of throughout the entirety of Gillamoorian history. Almost 10 years have passed since the cataclysm, and the newly united three civilizations work together in urgency to solve the mystery and complete the Trials before its 10-year time window comes to an end.", "summary": "A 2D 16-bit styled action MMORPG.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/trials-of-luna", "videos": [{"id": 172408, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "dFZ3hF90At0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dFZ3hF90At0", "title": "Trials of Luna Official Pre-Alpha Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dFZ3hF90At0/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}